{"5152210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LENG", "steam_appid": 5152210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VERTICAL MEGASTRUCTURE LEVELS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 levels of surreal vertical megastructure, all designed to melt your brain and satisfy that fiendish urge to absolutely send it.  Ascend the levels by platforming higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5152210/extras/338a5c839d13e8557b9d64c25171a8c5.poster.avif?t=1787866039\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5152210/extras/338a5c839d13e8557b9d64c25171a8c5.webm?t=1787866039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5152210/extras/338a5c839d13e8557b9d64c25171a8c5.mp4?t=1787866039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MOVEMENT COMBOS BUILD MOMENTUM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall jump. Dash. Grapple. 360, 180?  Chain them into each other and stay lifted. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5152210/extras/20dc2b5b1ead1c209364bf79d3dc8ae6.avif?t=1787866039\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every route through this place rewards momentum over caution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WEIGHTY DUBPLATE SOUNDTRACK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grimey, psychedelic dubstep and drum &amp; bass crafted from culture and experience. Original tracks from New Zealand and Australian dubstep carriers, weighty low-end, echoed wubs, 140 to 170BPM.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY REACTIVE WITH MUSIC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic rhythm system to boost game feel, execute abilities on a heavy bass-drop and you'll know.  The heavier the bassline gets, the more the game leans into you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't need to know a beat from a bar to feel this working. It's under the hood.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE HUD, ENVIRONMENT AND MUSIC ARE THE SAME SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The particles, the lighting, the interface aren't scripted to the soundtrack. It's reading the audio live and reacting to it, the same way a rave visualizer reads a DJ set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know it holds up, because we plug this game directly into the decks at real raves and let it run off the actual set being played in the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5152210/extras/0a2ee4f258d000e987f75c84d3c43c08.poster.avif?t=1787866039\" aria-label=\"GIF showing a real-life rave with LENG being played by attendees near the DJ controller\" width=330 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5152210/extras/0a2ee4f258d000e987f75c84d3c43c08.webm?t=1787866039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5152210/extras/0a2ee4f258d000e987f75c84d3c43c08.mp4?t=1787866039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOR THE PEOPLE WHO KNOW WHAT THIS IS FOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > If you already know what a wall of subs feels like in your chest, you'll know what to do with this. If you don't, you'll figure it out on the way up.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VERTICAL MEGASTRUCTURE LEVELS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 levels of surreal vertical megastructure, all designed to melt your brain and satisfy that fiendish urge to absolutely send it.  Ascend the levels by platforming higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5152210/extras/338a5c839d13e8557b9d64c25171a8c5.poster.avif?t=1787866039\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5152210/extras/338a5c839d13e8557b9d64c25171a8c5.webm?t=1787866039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5152210/extras/338a5c839d13e8557b9d64c25171a8c5.mp4?t=1787866039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MOVEMENT COMBOS BUILD MOMENTUM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall jump. Dash. Grapple. 360, 180?  Chain them into each other and stay lifted. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5152210/extras/20dc2b5b1ead1c209364bf79d3dc8ae6.avif?t=1787866039\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every route through this place rewards momentum over caution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WEIGHTY DUBPLATE SOUNDTRACK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grimey, psychedelic dubstep and drum &amp; bass crafted from culture and experience. Original tracks from New Zealand and Australian dubstep carriers, weighty low-end, echoed wubs, 140 to 170BPM.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY REACTIVE WITH MUSIC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic rhythm system to boost game feel, execute abilities on a heavy bass-drop and you'll know.  The heavier the bassline gets, the more the game leans into you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't need to know a beat from a bar to feel this working. It's under the hood.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE HUD, ENVIRONMENT AND MUSIC ARE THE SAME SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The particles, the lighting, the interface aren't scripted to the soundtrack. It's reading the audio live and reacting to it, the same way a rave visualizer reads a DJ set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know it holds up, because we plug this game directly into the decks at real raves and let it run off the actual set being played in the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5152210/extras/0a2ee4f258d000e987f75c84d3c43c08.poster.avif?t=1787866039\" aria-label=\"GIF showing a real-life rave with LENG being played by attendees near the DJ controller\" width=330 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5152210/extras/0a2ee4f258d000e987f75c84d3c43c08.webm?t=1787866039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5152210/extras/0a2ee4f258d000e987f75c84d3c43c08.mp4?t=1787866039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOR THE PEOPLE WHO KNOW WHAT THIS IS FOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > If you already know what a wall of subs feels like in your chest, you'll know what to do with this. If you don't, you'll figure it out on the way up.</p>", "short_description": "A bass-drenched psychedelic FPS set in a vertical megastructure built on pirate radio and rave culture.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5152210/a52e4ddc7c70490ad87cb89d35ab84107b44e303/header.jpg?t=1787866039", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5152210/aacb5c5ae119141d2aa38f42bd3d02ff58c879b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787866039", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5152210/aacb5c5ae119141d2